Seams between teams

`Checkout` calls `Inventory` and `Fraud`. The team `Shop` owns `Checkout`, the
team `Supply` owns `Inventory`, and the team `Risk` owns `Fraud`. Use the key
`owner`. Show the seams by owner.
---
Checkout -> Inventory, Fraud
Checkout { owner: Shop }
Inventory { owner: Supply }
Fraud { owner: Risk }
show seams by owner
